nter\"><em>Poznaj naszą ofertę</em></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center alignwide\"><em>W naszej palarni i kawiarni stawiamy na świeżo wypalane ziarna segmentu speciality oraz rzemieślnicze podejście do parzenia kawy. Wybierz interesujący Cię obszar, aby sprawdzić aktualne menu lokalu, zapisać się na warsztaty baristyczne lub zamówić ziarna do domu.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-mf-cien\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"right\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-mf-cien\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-align-right wp-element-button\" href=\"https://congenial-zebra-q7jjrprgwj5rf466x-8080.app.github.dev/oferta/kawiarnia-i-menu-2/\">Kawiarnia i menu</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-mf-cien\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"right\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-mf-cien\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-align-right wp-element-button\" href=\"https://congenial-zebra-q7jjrprgwj5rf466x-8080.app.github.dev/oferta/ziarna-na-wynos/\">Ziarna na wynos</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-mf-cien\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"right\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-mf-cien\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-align-right wp-element-button\" href=\"https://congenial-zebra-q7jjrprgwj5rf466x-8080.app.github.dev/oferta/warsztaty/\">Warsztaty</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-mf-karta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-mf-karta\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><em>Nasza kawa tygodnia</em></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><em>Etiopia Yirgacheffe – nuty jaśminu, bergamotki i białej brzoskwini. Dostępna na miejscu oraz w ziarnach na wynos.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Oferta','','publish','closed','closed','','oferta','','','2026-11-22 12:23:24','2026-11-22 12:23:24','',0,'https://congenial-zebra-q7jjrprgwj5rf466x-8080.app.github.dev/?page_id=11',0,'page','',0),
